WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.620
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:18.020
Last time: data is AI's food

3
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:25.440
Chapter 5 · Practice Makes Perfect

4
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:37.280
Is AI born smart? Think!

5
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:45.220
Meera gets a shiny new cycle!

6
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:57.110
First try: wobble, wobble… oops!

7
00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:11.680
She practised every evening

8
00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:28.480
By Sunday: zoom! Practice made her better.

9
00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:38.310
AI's first tries are wobbly too

10
00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:51.860
Cat → "dog". Cushion → "cat". Oops!

11
00:01:51.860 --> 00:02:11.500
Practice = trying again and again

12
00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:24.230
Each round, a little better

13
00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:33.980
First sums? A few mistakes!

14
00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:43.930
Practise · fix mistakes · get better

15
00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:52.980
Improve = get better, step by step

16
00:02:52.980 --> 00:03:03.150
How do we know it learned? Test it!

17
00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:07.790
Test = check with new examples

18
00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:18.580
New example = never seen in training

19
00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:30.360
Same photos? It may just remember them

20
00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:43.830
Class test: new sums, not practice ones

21
00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:54.450
New things check real learning

22
00:03:54.450 --> 00:04:11.590
Right on old photos, wrong on new. Why?

23
00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:24.940
It remembered, but didn't really learn "cat"

24
00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:34.030
Mistakes? Don't throw it away!

25
00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:53.630
Train → Try → Fix → Try again

26
00:04:53.630 --> 00:05:07.320
Each loop, a little better

27
00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:24.210
Put the improve loop in order!

28
00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:34.790
Train → Try → Fix labels → Try again

29
00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.690
Your turn: practice check

30
00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:49.880
Why test a cat finder on a NEW cat photo?

31
00:05:49.880 --> 00:06:04.350
It may just remember. New photos show real learning

32
00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:09.110
Practice makes AI better

33
00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:11.890
First tries are wobbly. That's okay!

34
00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:15.060
Test with NEW examples

35
00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:19.230
Train → Try → Fix → Try again

36
00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:30.440
Chapter 5 done · Unit 2 complete!

37
00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:37.240
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
